Package: dateblock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: block (sleep) until a cron-style moment in time
 Dateblock works like sleep, except that instead of waiting for a number of
 seconds it waits until a crontab-style schedule is matched.  It also
 supports matching on seconds and adding an extra drift time.

Package: libdateblock1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: cron-style date calculations - shared library
 The libdateblock shared library; it works out the next moment in time
 matching a cron-style schedule (with optional seconds and drift).
 .
 It is used by the dateblock tool and its Python and PHP bindings.

Package: libdateblock-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libdateblock1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: cron-style date calculations - development files
 Header files, pkg-config file and the linkable library needed to build
 programs that use libdateblock.

Package: python3-dateblock
Section: python
Architecture: any
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: cron-style blocking (sleep until a moment in time) - Python 3
 Python bindings for dateblock; block until (or just work out) the next
 moment in time matching a cron-style schedule.

Package: php-dateblock
Section: php
Architecture: any
Depends: ${php:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: cron-style blocking (sleep until a moment in time) - PHP
 PHP extension for dateblock; adds the dateblock() function, which blocks
 until (or just works out) the next moment in time matching a cron-style
 schedule.
